tests/ui/types/err_array_index.sky:3:7: error: index 3 is out of bounds for axis 0 of length 3
  |
3 | a = v[3]
  |       ^ valid indices are 0 to 2
  |     - this is Vector[3] [dimensionless]

tests/ui/types/err_array_index.sky:4:10: error: index 2 is out of bounds for axis 1 of length 2
  |
4 | b = A[0, 2]
  |          ^ valid indices are 0 to 1
  |     - this is Matrix[2,2] [dimensionless]

tests/ui/types/err_array_index.sky:5:7: error: index 2 is out of bounds for axis 0 of length 2
  |
5 | p = A[2, 0]
  |       ^ valid indices are 0 to 1
  |     - this is Matrix[2,2] [dimensionless]

tests/ui/types/err_array_index.sky:6:10: error: too many indices: Vector[3] has 1 axis, found 2 indices
  |
6 | d = v[1, 1]
  |          ^ this index has no axis
  |     - this is Vector[3] [dimensionless]

tests/ui/types/err_array_index.sky:7:7: error: an index must be dimensionless
  |
7 | e = v[1 m]
  |       ^^^ this is length

tests/ui/types/err_array_index.sky:8:7: error: an index must be an integer, found `1.5`
  |
8 | f = v[1.5]
  |       ^^^ not an integer

tests/ui/types/err_array_index.sky:9:7: error: an index cannot be negative
  |
9 | g = v[-1]
  |       ^^ negative
  = note: v0.1 counts from 0 and has no negative indices

tests/ui/types/err_array_index.sky:10:7: error: this slice is empty
   |
10 | q = v[2:1]
   |       ^^^ 2 is not less than 1
   = note: arrays are never empty in v0.1

tests/ui/types/err_array_index.sky:11:7: error: slice end 4 is out of bounds for axis 0 of length 3
   |
11 | j = v[0:4]
   |       ^^^ the axis has 3 elements

tests/ui/types/err_array_index.sky:13:5: error: cannot index a scalar
   |
13 | t = s[0]
   |     ^ this is Scalar [dimensionless]
   = note: only vectors and matrices have elements

tests/ui/types/err_array_index.sky:14:7: error: an index must be an integer, found Bool
